"Beta CoreLocation simulation. Requires Apple Maps installed and set up — Maps is the RemoteCall host process that drives the simulation.\\\\n\\\\nThis is a manual tool, not an installable package. Use Simulate Current Target to start; use Restore Real Location to stop simulation and return CoreLocation to the device's real providers. Each run opens the activity log and marks completion when the request returns.\\\\n\\\\nNot all apps respect the simulated location. Apps that use their own location validation or additional signals may ignore it.\\\\n\\\\nCredits: kolbicz for the RemoteCall/CLSimulationManager GPS spoofer prototype, and ezzuldinSt's LSpoof for picker/route references.\\\\n\\\\nWarning: this can affect more than maps. Location-tied system behavior, including time zone and date/time handling, may behave unexpectedly. Only use this if you know what you're doing." = "Beta CoreLocation simulation. Requires Apple Maps installed and set up — Maps is the RemoteCall host process that drives the simulation.\\\\n\\\\nThis is a manual tool, not an installable package. Use Simulate Current Target to start; use Restore Real Location to stop simulation and return CoreLocation to the device's real providers. Each run opens the activity log and marks completion when the request returns.\\\\n\\\\nNot all apps respect the simulated location. Apps that use their own location validation or additional signals may ignore it.\\\\n\\\\nCredits: kolbicz for the RemoteCall/CLSimulationManager GPS spoofer prototype, and ezzuldinSt's LSpoof for picker/route references.\\\\n\\\\nWarning: this can affect more than maps. Location-tied system behavior, including time zone and date/time handling, may behave unexpectedly. Only use this if you know what you're doing.";
